# Frontend

TypeScript strict, no any, no non-null assertions. Zod-validate every network response.

The browser only talks to our FastAPI. Never to TinyFish. Never handle API keys.

Design: dark forensic lab. Colors, radii, spacing, type scale come ONLY from design tokens in src/styles/tokens.css. No hard-coded hex values in components.

Banned: purple-to-blue gradients, glassmorphism blobs, emoji as icons, generic 3-up feature cards, centered hero text over gradient. Use lucide-react icons at 16/20px with 1.5 stroke.

Every interactive element has hover, focus-visible, active, disabled and loading states. Respect prefers-reduced-motion.

Accessible: semantic HTML, labelled controls, 4.5:1 contrast minimum.
